# Frontend Development Rules

## Technology

Use:

- React
- TypeScript
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui
- React Router
- TanStack Query

## Components

- Use functional components.
- Keep components focused on a single responsibility.
- Extract reusable components when repetition is meaningful.
- Do not over-componentize trivial UI.

## TypeScript

- Avoid `any`.
- Define clear types for API requests and responses.
- Reuse shared domain types where appropriate.

## API Communication

- Do not make duplicate API calls from multiple components.
- Keep API logic separate from UI components.
- Use TanStack Query for server-state management.

## Responsive Design

The application must work well on:

- Desktop
- Tablet
- Mobile

The active workout experience is mobile-first.

Touch targets should be suitable for mobile use.

## UI Principles

- Fast workout logging.
- Minimal unnecessary interactions.
- Clear visual hierarchy.
- Avoid clutter.